# Test artifacts must never enter the backend image build context.
# The docker simulator-sweep runner writes root-owned (mode 700)
# simulator-workspaces/ dirs under test-results/; Docker's context sender
# cannot read them and fails with "open ...: permission denied". These have
# no place in the backend image anyway. Also drop the usual Python/test cruft.
**/test-results/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
*.pyc
